      "code": "",
      "execution_output": "User: Hi! I’m Sophia Silva. I need some help with my upcoming reservations, and I’m pretty busy, so I’d like you to go through my future trips and figure out which flights meet the conditions I’m about to give you.\n\nCould you first tell me the flight durations for my upcoming reservations? I want to cancel the entire reservation for any trip that includes a flight longer than 4 hours. On the other hand, for any flights that are 3 hours or less including layovers, I’d like to upgrade to business wherever possible—but before you actually process any upgrades, please tell me the total cost.\n\nAlso, just so there’s no confusion: I’m healthy, I don’t have any health-related issue, and I do not want to upgrade a flight and then cancel it. Please don’t do that.\n\nLet me know what you need to pull up my account—I can give you my user ID if you need it.",
