      "thought": "I can pull up your account with your user ID — could you please provide it? (It usually looks something like `sophia_silva_123`.)\n\nOnce I have that, I’ll:\n1. List all your **upcoming** reservations and each flight’s scheduled departure/arrival times.\n2. Compute each flight’s **duration** (including any layover time for connecting itineraries, if you tell me you want total elapsed time).\n3. For any trip containing a flight **longer than 4 hours**, propose cancelling the entire reservation (with the reason and confirmation).\n4. For flights **3 hours or less**, propose a business-class upgrade and tell you the **total cost** before processing anything.\n\nAnd noted on your constraints: no health-related cancellation reasoning, and no upgrade-then-cancel — an upgraded reservation won’t be cancelled.",
